# Firmware licensing terms

Files under this `firmware/` directory (including prebuilt `.s37` images) are
licensed by Silicon Laboratories Inc. under the Master Software License
Agreement (MSLA):

https://www.silabs.com/about-us/legal/master-software-license-agreement

The prebuilt image is provided for convenience so you can run the BLE demo on
a BRD2601 board. The firmware does not depend on the Pac-Man web page and can
run independently.

To rebuild or modify the firmware, use the AI/ML SDK sample
`aiml_ble_soc_audio_classifier_efr32_micriumos` for `brd2601b` under the SDK
license terms.
